- * 0x10    4     Stream descriptor table offset
- * 0x14    2     Number of streams
- * 0x18    4     Presentation start time (90kHz ticks)
- * 0x1C    4     Presentation end time (90kHz ticks)
- * 0x20    4     Mux rate (bytes/sec)
